%description:
hysteresisFactor, which divided the serving cell's beacon SINR in dB to give the handover
margin, is replaced by hysteresis, a margin in dB. An ini file that still sets it would be
ignored without a message if the parameter were gone, and the handovers of the simulation
would silently follow the default margin. Setting it is an error at initialization.

%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%inifile: omnetpp.ini
[General]
network = simu5g.test.moduletest.lib.NrSessionTestNetwork

**.hysteresisFactor = 5

include ../../lib/defaults.ini

%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%exitcode: 1
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%contains: stderr
hysteresisFactor is replaced by hysteresis, in dB
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
